  "synth": "Serum",
  "note": "The ORIGINAL Serum (v1, distinct from Serum 2). Captured LIVE from the installed plugin hosted in Ableton Live (Mosh's in-process host crashes on Serum 1; Ableton hosts it fine and accepts tab clicks). Init patch, dark skin. 4 tabs (OSC/FX/MATRIX/GLOBAL — no MIX, vs Serum 2's 5); active tab marked by a BLUE dot. ENV 1 ADSR (ATTACK/HOLD/DECAY/SUSTAIN/RELEASE — no DELAY). Knobs read via the blue rim-tick reader (Serum marks each value with a saturated blue tick at the rim — robust across Serum 1 & 2; falls back to the white pointer on non-default skins). Coords in reference_size space; load_profile scales to any frame.",
